  "body": "### What is the issue with the HTML Standard?\n\nThe tests seem to expect it: https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/blob/8d124dbe46f46f55531f28f13eccf1113f794c12/uievents/interface/click-event.htm#L18-L20\n\nAnd browsers seem to pass the test: https://wpt.fyi/results/uievents/interface/click-event.htm?label=experimental&label=master&aligned\n\nhttps://w3c.github.io/pointerevents/#dom-pointerevent-pointerid kind of has some handwavy text about using -1 for not-an-actual-pointer but hooking this up to the actual event dispatch would be better.",
